# Jade Healing Spa — Agent Rules

Before any work, read `AGENTS.md` and `PROJECT_BRIEF.md`.

- Do not invent spa facts (name details, prices, services, address, awards, medical claims).
- Do not copy nhaspa.com.vn branding, text, images, or source code.
- MVP is informational only. No booking, payments, accounts, or extra backend.
- Do not start a later phase until prerequisites in `docs/STATUS.md` are complete and the owner has approved the gate.
- Do not deploy or merge to `main` without explicit owner approval.
- Keep research facts, interpretations, recommendations, and unresolved questions in separate sections.
- Mark unknown business content as `NEEDS OWNER INPUT`. Never fill it with invented copy on the live site.
- For new UI/features/pages/journeys after the site exists: use `docs/change-requests/` and the BA → Design → Dev → QA gates (see `AGENTS.md` section B). Do not skip roles unless the owner explicitly waives a gate.
